{"source_sha256":"ed2869946b0de9d97398c975a3dde8d5701250eb4c8776cb40907fe23c6300bb","page_number":9,"page_type":"mixed","blocks":[{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b1","text":"Attributes","bbox":[36.0,34.7,95.14,51.32]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b2","text":"• Player Characters (PCs) have just three attributes: Strength (STR), Dexterity (DEX), and Willpower (WIL).","bbox":[40.5,54.1,354.01,76.88]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b3","text":"• Roll 3d6 for each of your character’s attributes, in order. You may then swap any two of the results.","bbox":[40.5,80.6,353.2,103.38]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b4","text":"• Attributes are not universal descriptors. A character with a low STR is not necessarily hopelessly weak; they can still attempt to lift a heavy door or survive a deadly fight! Their risk is simply higher.","bbox":[40.5,107.1,342.46,140.88]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b5","text":"Hit Protection","bbox":[36.0,148.6,118.87,165.22]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b6","text":"• Roll 1d6 to determine your PC’s starting Hit Protection (HP), which reflects their ability to avoid damage in combat. It does not indicate a character’s health or fortitude, nor do they lose it for very long. (See Healing in the Core Rules (pg. 62).)","bbox":[40.5,168.0,353.33,212.78]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b7","text":"• If an attack takes a PC’s HP exactly to 0, the player must reference the Scars table (pg. 66).","bbox":[40.5,216.5,352.33,239.28]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b8","text":"Inventory","bbox":[36.0,247.0,92.94,263.62]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b9","text":"• Characters have a total of ten inventory slots but can only carry four items comfortably without the help of bags, backpacks, horses, carts, etc.","bbox":[40.5,266.4,346.2,289.18]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b10","text":"• Each PC starts with a Backpack that can hold up to six slots of items or Fatigue (pg. 62). Carts (which must be pulled with both hands), Horses, or Mules can make a huge difference in how much a PC can bring with them on an adventure. Hirelings can also be paid to carry equipment.","bbox":[40.5,292.9,355.04,337.68]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b11","text":"• Inventory is abstract, dependent only on the fiction as adjudicated by the Warden. Anyone carrying a full inventory (i.e. filling all 10 slots) is reduced to 0 HP. A character cannot fill more than ten slots.","bbox":[40.5,341.4,361.08,375.18]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b12","text":"Inventory Slots","bbox":[36.0,382.9,124.58,399.52]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b13","text":"• Most items take up one slot, unless otherwise indicated.","bbox":[40.5,402.3,271.0,414.08]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b14","text":"• Petty items do not take up any slots. Bulky items take up two slots.","bbox":[40.5,417.8,312.4,429.58]},{"id":"a-cairn-player-9-b15","text":"• A bag of coins worth less than 100gp is petty and does not occupy a slot.","bbox":[40.5,433.3,334.56,445.08]}],"reading_order":["a-cairn-player-9-b1","a-cairn-player-9-b2","a-cairn-player-9-b3","a-cairn-player-9-b4","a-cairn-player-9-b5","a-cairn-player-9-b6","a-cairn-player-9-b7","a-cairn-player-9-b8","a-cairn-player-9-b9","a-cairn-player-9-b10","a-cairn-player-9-b11","a-cairn-player-9-b12","a-cairn-player-9-b13","a-cairn-player-9-b14","a-cairn-player-9-b15"],"headings":[{"id":"h-cairn-player-9-1","block_id":"a-cairn-player-9-b1","level":2},{"id":"h-cairn-player-9-2","block_id":"a-cairn-player-9-b5","level":2},{"id":"h-cairn-player-9-3","block_id":"a-cairn-player-9-b8","level":2},{"id":"h-cairn-player-9-4","block_id":"a-cairn-player-9-b12","level":3}],"section_continuations":[{"id":"sc-cairn-player-8-to-9","source":{"page_number":8,"anchor":{"text":"Creating a Character","bbox":[36.0,33.839874267578125,235.97999572753906,61.53987121582031]}},"destination":{"page_number":9,"block_id":"a-cairn-player-9-b1"},"section_relation":"UNRESOLVED","content_continuity":"NONE"},{"id":"cairn-player-9-to-10-different-section","source":{"page_number":9,"block_id":"a-cairn-player-9-b15"},"destination":{"page_number":10,"block_id":"a-cairn-player-10-b25"},"section_relation":"DIFFERENT_SECTION","content_continuity":"NONE"}]}
